@startuml
title Chatbot RAG Function Design

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction

actor Learner
boundary "Chatbot UI" as UI
control "Chat API" as API
control "Intent / Prompt Builder" as Prompt
control "RAG Retriever" as Retriever
database "knowledge_chunks" as Chunks
database "chat_conversations\nchat_messages" as ChatDB
cloud "OpenRouter /\nOpenAI-compatible API" as AI

Learner --> UI : Ask question
UI --> API : Send message + history
API --> Retriever : Retrieve sources
Retriever --> Chunks : Query top-k chunks
Chunks --> Retriever : Sources + metadata
Retriever --> API : Retrieved context
API --> Prompt : Build grounded prompt
Prompt --> AI : Prompt + sources
AI --> API : Generated answer
API --> ChatDB : Store conversation/message
API --> UI : Answer + sources
UI --> Learner : Display Kami response

@enduml
